AquaWebKit -- Acknowledgements

This product is AquaWebKit, WebKit built for OS X 10.9 from the mavericks-backport
branch of https://github.com/Wowfunhappy/WebKit, together with the third-party
libraries whose licenses follow. That repository holds the source of WebKit, of this
port's AquaWebKitSupport directory, and of the build scripts.
AquaWebKitSupport/deps/build_deps.sh names the upstream release each third-party
library is built from, and AquaWebKitSupport/deps/patches holds the changes applied
to them.

